Description:It is the opponent's turn and their Sickle Ripper (wither) is attacking you. You control Goblin Sky Raider with two +1/+1 counters, Luxior, Giada's Gift (unattached) and three Wastes. The opponent is at 5 life. Reduce the opponent to 0 life by the end of your next turn.
